sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant AG as Agent Runtime
    participant PL as Planner/Reasoner (GLM 5.2)
    participant TL as Tool Broker
    participant EV as Evals & Guardrails
    participant OF as Object Fabric (OAG)
    User->>AG: goal (natural language)
    AG->>PL: plan (decompose)
    PL->>OF: retrieve grounded context (OAG)
    OF-->>PL: objects/links/actions
    PL->>TL: call tool / action
    TL->>EV: pre-flight guardrail + purpose check
    EV-->>TL: allow / gate / deny
    TL-->>AG: tool result
    AG->>EV: post-hoc evaluation (trace)
    AG-->>User: answer + citations + reasoning